2.88, "most people find they're not reaching for a tissue"], [32.88, 34.1, "the second they sit up."], [34.34, 36.72, "That's because every mite the lure pulls out"], [36.72, 40.06, "stops dropping its 20 pellets a day of Derpy One"], [40.06, 41.16, "where your face sleeps."], [41.54, 43.62, "The allergen that breaks down the junctions"], [43.62, 45.36, "holding your airway lining together."], [45.84, 47.32, "Week two, you stop wondering"], [47.32, 48.74, "if you're coming down with something"], [48.74, 50.78, "and that clearer by lunch feeling"], [50.78, 52.18, "starts showing up at breakfast."], [52.6, 53.56, "That's the adhesive,"], [53.98, 56.2, "locking every mite the lure pulls in."], [56.4, 58.66, "So what it catches comes out of your bed"], [58.66, 60.06, "instead of back into it."], [60.28, 61.16, "The craziest part?"], [61.42, 62.88, "You haven't sprayed a thing."], [63.2, 64.38, "You haven't stripped the bed."], [64.64, 66.04, "You haven't bought a new mattress."], [66.42, 67.76, "But every single night,"], [68.04, 70.38, "the mattress you sleep on is giving them up."], [70.58, 71.78, "Week four, by now,"], [72.02, 73.68, "most people are sleeping through more"], [73.68, 75.44, "and waking up less blocked."], [75.76, 77.66, "Mornings start the way they did years ago."], [77.94, 79.24, "And that background dread"], [79.24, 81.14, "before you even open your eyes"], [81.14, 82.94, "is finally gone for you"], [82.94, 84.8, "and for whoever shares your bed."], [85.12, 86.16, "How is this possible?"], [86.54, 88.46, "Most mite products try to kill them."], [88.46, 90.78, "But every dead one stays in the bed,"], [90.98, 93.26, "carrying the same allergen as a live one."], [93.56, 95.36, "This one pulls them out alive."], [95.78, 97.22, "Dust mites have no eyes."], [97.46, 98.74, "They find each other by scent,"], [98.98, 99.88, "a chemical signal."], [100.14, 102.0, "Capture cards mimic that signal."], [102.3, 103.86, "Drawing them up out of the foam"], [103.86, 105.7, "and the adhesive locks them on."], [106.04, 107.34, "It's lure and trap."], [107.6, 110.0, "The way pest control has caught things for decades,"], [110.36, 112.52, "aimed at the one place nobody had."], [112.82, 114.12, "The inside of a mattress."], [114.52, 116.86, "Because a dead mite can't walk to a card."], [116.86, 120.74, "Over 30,000 homes are already pulling them out of their beds"], [120.74, 122.38, "instead of washing around them."], [122.6, 125.02, "Up to 65% off right now."], [125.3, 128.28, "With a 90-day money-back guarantee, tap below."]]}